Retrieve the Town Map from Daisy in Pallet Town	
Obtain the POTION_SAMPLE	healing a Pokemon outside of a Center
Battle the Rival in Oak's Lab	leaving Pallet Town
Collect the OAKS_PARCEL from the clerk at the Viridian City Poke Mart and deliver it to Professor Oak in his lab in Pallet Town	
Obtain the POKEDEX	tracking caught Pokemon
Battle the Rival on Route 22	proving strength early in the journey
Catch a NIDORAN_F	adding a Poison-type to the party
Defeat trainers in Viridian Forest	access to the path toward Pewter City
Raise all party members to level 12	the ability to challenge Brock on equal footing
Obtain TM_BIDE	teaching a Pokemon the move Bide
Obtain the BOULDERBADGE	stopping wild Pokemon and trainers from fleeing
Defeat trainers on Route N	further exploration of the area beyond Pewter City
Obtain the MOON_STONE	evolving certain Pokemon
Obtain HP_UP	increasing a Pokemon's maximum health
Obtain TM_MEGA_PUNCH	teaching a Pokemon the move Mega Punch
Reach Route 4	accessing the path to Cerulean City
Obtain the HELIX_FOSSIL	the ability to revive an ancient Pokemon
Defeat the Mt. Moon Super Nerd	completion of the Mt. Moon exploration
Obtain TM_WATER_GUN	teaching a Pokemon the move Water Gun
Obtain TOWN_MAP	viewing the current location on a map
Obtain TM_WHIRLWIND	teaching a Pokemon the move Whirlwind
Obtain RARE_CANDY	increasing a Pokemon's level instantly
Obtain TM_THUNDER_WAVE	teaching a Pokemon the move Thunder Wave
Obtain NUGGET	selling it for a large sum of money
Obtain the S.S. Ticket	boarding the S.S. Anne
Obtain ESCAPE_ROPE	exiting caves or dungeons instantly
Obtain TM_BUBBLEBEAM	teaching a Pokemon the move BubbleBeam
Obtain MOON_STONE	evolving a Pokemon that requires a Moon Stone
Chase the Team Rocket thief out of the burgled house in Cerulean City	
Obtain HELIX_FOSSIL	reviving a prehistoric Pokemon
Obtain TM_DIG	teaching a Pokemon the move Dig
Receive the BIKE_VOUCHER from the Pokemon Fan Club chairman in Vermilion City	
Obtain TM_BODY_SLAM	teaching a Pokemon the move Body Slam
Obtain HM_CUT	cutting small trees to access new areas
Obtain TM_THUNDERBOLT	teaching a Pokemon the move Thunderbolt
Obtain TM_TELEPORT	teaching a Pokemon the move Teleport
Obtain EEVEE	evolving it into various forms
Obtain TM_MEGA_DRAIN	teaching a Pokemon the move MegaDrain
Obtain S_S_TICKET	boarding the S.S. Anne
Talk to the Game Corner owner to reveal the Rocket Hideout	
Obtain LIFT_KEY	accessing the elevator in the Rocket Hideout
Obtain IRON	increasing a Pokemon's Defense stat
